#: about.php:29 include/global_arrays.php:2655 lib/html.php:2901
msgid "About Cacti"
msgstr "Ibyerekeye Cacti"

#: about.php:42
msgid "Cacti is designed to be a complete graphing solution based on the RRDtool Time Series Database (TSDB) and Graphing solution. Its goal is to make the Network Administrator's job easier by taking care of all the important details necessary to create meaningful Graphs."
msgstr "Cacti yateguwe ngo ibe igisubizo cyuzuye cyo gukora ibishushanyo gishingiye ku bubiko bw'amakuru akurikirana mu gihe (TSDB) bwa RRDtool n'igisubizo cyo gukora ibishushanyo. Intego yayo ni ukoroshya akazi k'Umuyobozi w'umuyoboro w'itumanaho yita ku bintu byose by'ingenzi bikenewe ngo hakorwe Ibishushanyo bifite icyo bisobanura."

#: about.php:44
#, php-format
msgid "Please see the official %sCacti website%s for information on how to use Cacti, get support, and updates."
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba %surubuga rwemewe rwa Cacti%s kugira ngo ubone amakuru y'uko wakoresha Cacti, uko wabona ubufasha, n'amavugurura."

#: about.php:48
msgid "Active Developers"
msgstr "Abatunganya porogaramu bakora ubu"

#: about.php:49
msgid "Developers working on Cacti, its Architecture, Documentation and Future Releases."
msgstr "Abatunganya porogaramu bakora kuri Cacti, Imiterere yayo, Inyandiko zisobanura n'Amasohoro azaza."

#: about.php:61
msgid "Honorable Mentions"
msgstr "Abashimirwa by'umwihariko"

#: about.php:62
msgid "Contributors to Documentation, QA, Packaging, the Forums and our YouTube page."
msgstr "Abagize uruhare mu nyandiko zisobanura, kugenzura ubuziranenge (QA), gupakira porogaramu, ibiganiro (Forums) n'urupapuro rwacu rwa YouTube."

#: about.php:70
msgid "Emeritus Members"
msgstr "Abanyamuryango bacyuye igihe mu cyubahiro"

#: about.php:71
msgid "Members of the original Cacti Group that have since moved on in their careers.  We continue to wish them the best."
msgstr "Abanyamuryango bo mu itsinda rya mbere rya Cacti bagiye mu yindi mirimo. Dukomeje kubifuriza ibyiza."

#: about.php:84
msgid "Thanks"
msgstr "Gushimira"

#: about.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "A very special thanks to %sTobi Oetiker%s, the creator of %sRRDtool%s and the very popular %sMRTG%s."
msgstr "Ishimirwa ryihariye cyane kuri %sTobi Oetiker%s, uwahanze %sRRDtool%s na %sMRTG%s ikunzwe cyane."

#: about.php:90
msgid "The users of Cacti"
msgstr "Abakoresha ba Cacti"

#: about.php:91
msgid "Especially anyone who has taken the time to create an issue report, or otherwise help fix a Cacti related problems. Also to anyone who has contributed to supporting Cacti."
msgstr "Cyane cyane umuntu wese wafashe umwanya wo gutanga raporo y'ikibazo, cyangwa se ugafasha gukemura ibibazo bifitanye isano na Cacti. Ndetse n'umuntu wese wagize uruhare mu gushyigikira Cacti."

#: about.php:96
msgid "License"
msgstr "Uruhushya"

#: about.php:98
msgid "Cacti is licensed under the GNU GPL:"
msgstr "Cacti ifite uruhushya rwa GNU GPL:"

#: about.php:102 lib/installer.php:1866
msgid "This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software Foundation; either version 2 of the License, or (at your option) any later version."
msgstr "Iyi porogaramu ni porogaramu yisanzuye; ushobora kuyikwirakwiza no/cyangwa kuyihindura ukurikije amategeko ya GNU General Public License nk'uko yasohowe na Free Software Foundation; haba verisiyo ya 2 y'Uruhushya, cyangwa (uko ubihisemo) verisiyo iyo ari yo yose izaza nyuma."

#: about.php:110
msgid "This program is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details."
msgstr "Iyi porogaramu ikwirakwizwa hizewe ko izagira akamaro, ariko NTA BWISHINGIZI NA BUCYE, ndetse nta n'ubwishingizi bwihariye bwo gucuruzwa cyangwa bwo guhuza n'intego runaka. Reba GNU General Public License kugira ngo ubone ibisobanuro birambuye."

