msgstr "Gushakisha ku buryo bwikora mu ibarura rishya"

#: include/global_form.php:178
msgid "Auto Detect/Set on first Re-Index"
msgstr "Gushakisha/Gushyiraho ku buryo bwikora mu ibarura rishya rya mbere"

