#: include/global_settings.php:436
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gutanga uburenganzira ku Gishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php:437
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Hari uburyo bune bwo kumenya uburenganzira bw'Umukoresha ku Bishushanyo.  Ubwa mbere ni 'Bwemerera' (Permissive).  Mu igenamiterere rya 'Bwemerera', Umukoresha akenera gusa uburenganzira ku Gishushanyo, ku Gikoresho cyangwa ku Nyandikorugero y'Igishushanyo kugira ngo agere ku Bishushanyo bijyanye na byo.  Mu buryo bwa 'Bufunga' (Restrictive), Umukoresha agomba kuba afite uburenganzira ku Gishushanyo, ku Gikoresho, ndetse no ku Nyandikorugero y'Igishushanyo kugira ngo agere ku Gishushanyo.  Ubu buryo bubiri bwa mbere bugira ibibazo byo kwaguka ku masisitemu manini cyane.  Kubera iyo mpamvu, hari andi mahitamo abiri yiyongeraho.  Ayo ni 'Bushingiye ku Gikoresho' (Device Based), bisobanura ko niba ufite uburenganzira ku Gikoresho, ubona n'uburenganzira ku Bishushanyo byacyo.  N'ubwa nyuma ni 'Bushingiye ku Nyandikorugero y'Igishushanyo' (Graph Template Based), bisobanura ko niba ufite uburenganzira ku 'Nyandikorugero y'Igishushanyo', ubona uburenganzira ku Bishushanyo byose by'Ibikoresho by'iyo Nyandikorugero."

#: include/global_settings.php:441
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Bwemerera"

#: include/global_settings.php:442
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Bufunga"

#: include/global_settings.php:443
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Bushingiye ku Gikoresho"

