msgstr "Niba bishyizwe ku Bworoshye, Ibishushanyo n'Inkomoko y'amakuru bishobora kuremwa gusa bivuye muri Ibishushanyo Bishya.  Niba ari ku Rwego rwo hejuru, uburyo bwa kera bwo kurema Ibishushanyo n'Inkomoko y'amakuru burashyigikirwa."

#: include/global_settings.php:453
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Bworoshye"

#: include/global_settings.php:454 lib/html.php:2949
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Urwego rwo hejuru"

#: include/global_settings.php:458
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Erekana ubufasha bw'Ifishi/Igenamiterere mu murongo umwe"

#: include/global_settings.php:459
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, ubufasha bw'Ifishi n'Igenamiterere buzagaragara aho bwanditse imbere.  Bitabaye ibyo, buzagaragara igihe utunze imbeba kuri buto y'ubufasha."

#: include/global_settings.php:464
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Ubufasha bw'ipaji bwo ku bubiko bw'imbere gusa"

#: include/global_settings.php:465
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Mu buryo bw'ibanze ubufasha bw'ipaji ya Cacti bubarizwa kuri docs.cacti.net.  Ariko, niba sisitemu yawe idafite murandasi, ushobora gukuramo inyandiko zisobanura mu buryo bwa HTML ukazishyira ahitwa 'docs' kuri seriveri yawe ya Cacti.  Niba uhisemo gukoresha gusa ahantu h'imbere ku nyandiko z'ubufasha bw'ipaji, shyira akamenyetso muri aka kadirishya."

#: include/global_settings.php:470
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Igenzura ryo gusiba"

#: include/global_settings.php:471
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Baza umukoresha mbere yo gusiba ikintu."

#: include/global_settings.php:476
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo kubungabunga Inkomoko y'amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php:477
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Iyo bifunguwe, Cacti izashyira buto yo guhitamo (Radio Button) kuri Siba Inkomoko y'amakuru zijyanye n'Igishushanyo igihe usiba Ibishushanyo.  Icyitonderwa: Cacti ntizemerera gusiba Inkomoko y'amakuru niba zikoreshwa mu bindi Bishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php:482
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Gufungura Ibishushanyo mu buryo bwikora"

#: include/global_settings.php:483
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Iyo bifunguwe, Cacti ntizafunga Ibishushanyo.  Ibi bituma umuntu ashobora guhindura vuba ku giti cyawe Inkomoko y'amakuru zijyanye n'Igishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php:488
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Hisha Imbonerahamwe (Dashboard) ya Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php:489
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Bikoreshwa hamwe n'Ubushobozi bw'Imiyoboro yo hanze bwa Cacti.  Ukoresheje iri genamiterere, ushobora guhisha Imbonerahamwe ya Cacti, kugira ngo werekane ipaji yawe bwite gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php:494
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Fungura Gukurura no Kurekura (Drag-N-Drop)"

#: include/global_settings.php:495
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Bimwe mu bibuga by'imikorere bya Cacti bishyigikira Gukurura no Kurekura (Drag-N-Drop).  Niba bihiswemo, aya mahitamo azafungurwa.  Icyitonderwa: Ku bakoresha bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, aya mahitamo ashobora guhagarikwa."

#: include/global_settings.php:500
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Umutekano w'urubuga"

#: include/global_settings.php:505
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Tegeka ko ukwihuza kunyura kuri HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php:506
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, kugerageza kwose kwinjira muri Cacti kuzayoborwa kuri HTTPS kugira ngo umutekano wo hejuru wizerwe."

#: include/global_settings.php:511
msgid "Allow Unsafe Remote Data Collector HTTPS"
msgstr "Emera HTTPS itizewe y'Ikusanyamakuru rya kure"

#: include/global_settings.php:512
msgid "Allow the use of Self Signed Certificates and allow the hostname of the Certificate to differ from that of the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Emera ikoreshwa ry'Ibyemezo byisinyiye ubwabyo (Self Signed Certificates) kandi wemere ko izina rya seriveri riri ku Cyemezo ritandukana n'iry'Ikusanyamakuru rya kure."

#: include/global_settings.php:517
msgid "Allow Unsafe Metacharacters in Data Input Methods"
msgstr "Emera inyuguti zidasanzwe ziteje akaga mu Buryo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php:518
msgid "Historically, Cacti administrators created simple Data Input Methods that include commands like \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" to represent a numeric value for use in Cacti Graphs.  In earlier versions of Cacti, this was permitted.  However, this is an unsafe practice as it is a gateway for third party users to publish insecure Data Templates.  In modern Cacti, these types of practices should be avoided.  However, we provide this option if you have older Data Input Methods that contain these unsafe Meta Characters and have not converted them to local scripts in the 'scripts' directory.  When this option is unchecked, Cacti restricts shell-style metacharacters such as quotation marks, curly brackets, vertical bars, backslashes, and backticks.  Cacti continues to allow greater-than and less-than signs for things like <path_cacti> and for input parameters, but if this option is unchecked, that is the limit of their permitted use."
msgstr "Mu mateka, abayobozi ba Cacti bakoraga Uburyo bworoshye bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru burimo amabwiriza nka \"ps -ef | grep something | wc -l\" kugira ngo berekane umubare ukoreshwa mu Bishushanyo bya Cacti.  Muri verisiyo za kera za Cacti, ibi byari byemewe.  Ariko, ubu ni uburyo butizewe kuko butuma abandi bakoresha bashobora gutangaza Inyandikorugero z'Amakuru zidafite umutekano.  Muri Cacti y'iki gihe, ibikorwa nk'ibi bigomba kwirindwa.  Nyamara, dutanga aya mahitamo niba ufite Uburyo bwa kera bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru burimo izi nyuguti zidasanzwe ziteje akaga kandi ukaba utarazihinduye ngo zibe inyandikoporogaramu z'imbere mu bubiko bwa 'scripts'.  Iyo aya mahitamo adahiswemo, Cacti ihagarika inyuguti zidasanzwe zimeze nka shell nk'utwuguruzo n'utwugarizo, udukubo dutumbagiye, imirongo ihagaritse, imirongo ihengamye isubira inyuma, n'utudomo twa backtick.  Cacti ikomeza kwemerera ibimenyetso byo kuruta no kuba munsi ku bintu nka <path_cacti> no ku bipimo byinjizwa, ariko niba aya mahitamo adahiswemo, aho ni ho ikoreshwa ryazo ryemewe rigarukira."

#: include/global_settings.php:524
msgid "Content-Security Script Policy"
msgstr "Politiki y'Umutekano w'Ibirimo ku nyandikoporogaramu (CSP)"

#: include/global_settings.php:525
msgid "Controls the script-src CSP policy.  In Nonce Modes, Cacti Plugins that use inline JavaScript must include the nonce attribute from Cacti's builtin function 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Otherwise, those scripts will be blocked by the browser.  Currently, Cacti only allows reporting on Cacti Plugins that do not properly use Nonce Mode.  In the future, we will allow Administrators to block such plugins from using their inline JavaScript if they are not using Nonces."
msgstr "Igenzura politiki ya CSP ya script-src.  Muri Nonce Modes, Imigereka ya Cacti ikoresha JavaScript yanditse imbere mu ipaji igomba gushyiramo ikiranga cya nonce gituruka mu mumaro wubatse muri Cacti witwa 'CactiSecureHeaders::getNonceAttribute()'. Bitabaye ibyo, izo nyandikoporogaramu zizahagarikwa na mushakisha (browser).  Kuri ubu, Cacti yemera gusa gutanga raporo ku Migereka ya Cacti idakoresha neza Nonce Mode.  Mu gihe kizaza, tuzemerera Abayobozi guhagarika iyo migereka gukoresha JavaScript zayo zanditse imbere mu ipaji niba idakoresha Nonces."

#: include/global_settings.php:528
msgid "Allow Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Emerera JavaScript yo mu murongo itagira Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php:529
msgid "Allow both unsafe-eval and Non-Nonced Inline JavaScript"
msgstr "Emerera unsafe-eval hamwe na JavaScript yo mu murongo itagira Nonce"

#: include/global_settings.php:530
msgid "Nonce Mode - Reporting Only"
msgstr "Uburyo bwa Nonce - Gutanga raporo gusa"

#: include/global_settings.php:534 include/global_settings.php:549
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI ya raporo y'irengagiza rya CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php:535
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use <url_path>/csp_report.php. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL aho mushakisha yohereza hakoreshejwe POST raporo z'irengagiza rya CSP mu buryo bwa nonce-report na nonce. Siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe <url_path>/csp_report.php. Igomba kubamo inyuguti za URL zitekanye gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php:541
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Inkomoko zisimbura za Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php:542
msgid "Space delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can includes wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amazina y'imbuga atandukanyijwe n'umwanya azemererwa kugerwaho hanze ya seriveri y'urubuga ubwayo. Ibi ni ingenzi ku bakoresha bahitamo gukoresha CDN, cyangwa urubuga rwakira amadosiye. Inkomoko zishobora kubamo utumenyetso twa wildcard urugero: *.mydomain.com, cyangwa porotokole, urugero: https://*.example.com. Izi nkomoko zisimbura zikubiyemo ubwoko bw'amashusho, CSS na JavaScript gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php:550
msgid "URL where browsers POST CSP violation reports in nonce-report and nonce modes. Leave empty to use /cacti/csp_report.php at the installation root. Must contain only safe URL characters."
msgstr "URL aho mushakisha yohereza hakoreshejwe POST raporo z'irengagiza rya CSP mu buryo bwa nonce-report na nonce. Siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe /cacti/csp_report.php mu muzi w'ishyirwamo. Igomba kubamo inyuguti za URL zitekanye gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php:562
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Emera ikorwa ryikora ry'Ibishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php:563
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Iyo bihagaritswe, ikora ryikora rya Cacti ntirizakora Igishushanyo na kimwe mu buryo bwikora. Ibi ni ingirakamaro iyo uhindura igenamiterere ry'Igikoresho kugira ngo wirinde gukora Ibishushanyo bishya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Guhamagara amategeko y'ikora ryikora mu buryo busanzwe bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php:568
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Emera ikorwa ryikora ry'ibintu byo mu giti"

#: include/global_settings.php:569
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Iyo bihagaritswe, ikora ryikora rya Cacti ntirizakora ikintu na kimwe cyo mu giti mu buryo bwikora. Ibi ni ingirakamaro iyo uhindura igenamiterere ry'Igikoresho cyangwa ry'Igishushanyo kugira ngo wirinde gukora ibyinjira bishya mu giti buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Guhamagara amategeko mu buryo busanzwe bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php:573
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Imeri yakira amamenyesha y'ikora ryikora"

#: include/global_settings.php:574
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Aderesi ya imeri yo koherezaho amamenyesha y'ikora ryikora igihe bitatanzwe ku rwego rw'umuyoboro w'ikora ryikora. Niba iki gice cyangwa agaciro k'umuyoboro w'ikora ryikora bisizwe birimo ubusa, Cacti izakoresha konti ya imeri y'Umuyobozi mukuru wa Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php:580
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Izina ryohereza amamenyesha y'ikora ryikora"

#: include/global_settings.php:581
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Izina rya imeri rikoreshwa ku mamenyesha y'ikora ryikora igihe bitatanzwe ku rwego rw'umuyoboro w'ikora ryikora. Niba iki gice cyangwa agaciro k'umuyoboro w'ikora ryikora bisizwe birimo ubusa, Cacti izakoresha Izina ryohereza risanzwe rya sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php:588
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Imeri yohereza amamenyesha y'ikora ryikora"

#: include/global_settings.php:589
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Aderesi ya imeri ikoreshwa ku mamenyesha y'ikora ryikora igihe bitatanzwe ku rwego rw'umuyoboro w'ikora ryikora. Niba iki gice cyangwa agaciro k'umuyoboro w'ikora ryikora bisizwe birimo ubusa, Cacti izakoresha Aderesi ya imeri yohereza isanzwe ya sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php:595
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Ibyagenwe fatizo by'inyandikorugero y'Igishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php:601
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Igerageza ry'Inkomoko y'amakuru y'inyandikorugero y'Igishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php:602
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Hitamo aka kazu niba wifuza kugerageza Inkomoko z'amakuru mbere yo kuzikora ku nyandikorugero nshya n'izatumijwe vuba z'Ibishushanyo. Iyo Igerageza ry'Inkomoko z'amakuru ryemewe, niba Inkomoko y'amakuru idatanze amakuru yemewe, Igishushanyo ntikizakorwa. Iri genamiterere ni ingenzi niba wifuza kugira Inyandikorugero y'Igikoresho rusange ishobora gukubiyemo inyandikorugero nyinshi z'Ibishushanyo zishobora gukoreshwa ku buryo buhitamo bitewe n'imiterere y'Igikoresho ubwacyo. Icyitonderwa: Niba ufite inyandikomvugo imara igihe kirekire ikora nk'Inkomoko y'amakuru, igihe cyo gukora Ibishushanyo kiziyongera."

#: include/global_settings.php:607
