msgstr "Kuboneka/Kugerwaho fatizo ku Bikoresho bishya byose. Uburyo Cacti izakoresha mu kumenya niba Igikoresho kiboneka kugira ngo gikusanyweho amakuru. <br><i>ICYITONDERWA: Birasabwa ko byibuze buri gihe hahitwamo SNMP.</i>"

