msgstr "Inyandiko ntarengwa"

#: include/global_settings.php:2170
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Niba imbonerahamwe y'ibisohoka ya Boost irenze iki gipimo mu mubare w'inyandiko, ivugurura rizahita ribaho."

#: include/global_settings.php:2177
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w'ibintu by'inkomoko y'amakuru ku nshuro imwe"

#: include/global_settings.php:2178
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Kugira ngo imikorere irusheho kuba myiza, igikoresho kivugurura RRD cya Boost gikeneye kumenya umubare w'ibintu by'inkomoko y'amakuru bigomba gufatwa ku nshuro imwe.  Witonde ntushyireho umubare munini cyane kuko imikorere yo gukora ibishushanyo mu gihe cy'amavugurura manini ishobora guhungabana.  Niba uhuye n'ubukererwe mu gukora ibishushanyo cyangwa mu gukusanya amakuru mu gihe cy'amavugurura, gabanya uyu mubare.  Agaciro fatizo ni 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php:2184
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Uburebure ntarengwa bw'ibishingirwaho mu itegeko"

#: include/global_settings.php:2185
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Iyo Boost yohereje amategeko yo kuvugurura kuri RRDtool, ntigomba kurenza uburebure ntarengwa bw'ibishingirwaho mu itegeko bwa sisitemu y'imikorere.  Ibi bihinduka bitewe na sisitemu y'imikorere n'urwego rwa kernel.  Urugero: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ nta mupaka"

#: include/global_settings.php:2192
