#: index.php:89
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Cacti Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Cacti's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Cacti Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Cacti Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>ICYITONDERWA:</strong> Winjiye mu Mukusanyi w'amakuru wa kure. Igihe ari <b>'ku murongo'</b>, uzashobora kureba no kugenzura igice kinini cy'Urubuga Nyamukuru rwa Cacti nk'aho winjiye muri rwo. Nanone, ni ngombwa kumenya ko Abakusanyi b'amakuru ba kure basabwa gukoresha igice cya Serivisi zo Kongera Imikorere ya Cacti cyitwa <b>'Kuvugurura igihe bikenewe'</b>, kandi buri gihe tugira inama yo gukoresha Spine. Igihe Umukusanyi w'amakuru wa kure ari <b>'hanze y'umurongo'</b>, urubuga rw'Abakusanyi b'amakuru ba kure ruzaba rufite amakuru make cyane. Ariko kandi, ruzabika amavugurura yose by'agateganyo kugeza igihe Ububiko bw'amakuru Nyamukuru bwa Cacti na Seriveri y'Urubuga bizongera kugerwaho. Hanyuma ruzohereza ibisohoka by'imbonerahamwe ya Boost mu Bubiko bw'amakuru Nyamukuru bwa Cacti kugira ngo bivugururwe."

#: index.php:94
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Cacti Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>ICYITONDERWA:</strong> Kugeza ubu, nta na kimwe mu byongereza by'ibanze bya Cacti cyongeye gutegurwa kugira ngo gikorane n'Abakusanyi b'amakuru ba kure. Kubera iyo mpamvu, ibyongereza nka MacTrack na HMIB, bisaba kugera ku bikoresho mu buryo butaziguye, ntibizakorana n'Abakusanyi b'amakuru ba kure muri iki gihe. Ariko kandi, ibyongereza nka Thold bizakora igihe cyose Umukusanyi w'amakuru wa kure ari mu buryo bwa <b>'ku murongo'</b>."

