msgstr "urugero: Niba Intera ya Raporo ari 'Month(s)', icyo gihe '2' bisobanura Buri 'mezi 2 uhereye ku gihe gikurikira cyo kohereza imeyili.' Hanyuma, niba ukoresha Intera za Raporo z'Ukwezi ('Month(s)'), 'Umunsi w'icyumweru' na 'Umunsi w'ukwezi' byombi bibarwa bishingiye ku Gihe cyo kohereza imeyili washyizeho hejuru."

