msgid "Your Cacti database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Cacti database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "Konti yo kwinjira mu bubiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti yawe ntiyemerewe kugera ku bubiko bwa TimeZone ya MySQL. Nyamuneka ha konti y'ububiko bwa Cacti uburenganzira bwa \"select\" ku mbonerahamwe ya \"time_zone_name\" iri mu bubiko bwa \"mysql\", kandi wuzuze amakuru ya TimeZone ya MySQL mbere yo gukomeza."

#: lib/installer.php:2124
