#: lib/installer.php:2169
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Igihe habonetse ibibazo, bigirwa inama cyane ko wasiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa mucukumbuzi yawe, ugafunga maze ukongera ugafungura mucukumbuzi yawe (si agashami Cacti irimo gusa) maze ukongera ukagerageza, mbere yo kugeza ikibazo kuri The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php:2170
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Mu bihe bidasanzwe, twagiye tubona raporo z'abakoresha bahura n'ibibazo bito bitewe n'impinduka muri kode. Ibi bibazo biterwa na mucukumbuzi ikomeza kubika kode ya mbere y'ivugurura kandi nubwo twafashe ingamba zo kugabanya amahirwe y'uko ibyo biba, birashobora gukomeza kubaho. Niba ukeneye amabwiriza y'uburyo wasiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa mucukumbuzi yawe, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> ni intangiriro nziza."

#: lib/installer.php:2171
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Niba nyuma yo gusiba ububiko bw'agateganyo no kongera gufungura mucukumbuzi yawe ugikomeza guhura n'ibibazo, nyamuneka tubimenyeshe tuzagerageza kumenya impamvu yabyo."

