msgstr "Uburyo Cacti izagerageza kwemeza umwirondoro kuri seriveri ya LDAP.<blockquote><i>Ntushakishe</i> - Nta gushakisha Izina Ritandukanya (DN) kubaho, hageragezwa gusa guhuza hakoreshejwe imiterere y'Izina Ritandukanya (DN) yatanzwe.<br><br><i>Gushakisha utamenyekanye</i> - Hageragezwa gushakisha izina ry'umukoresha mu bubiko bwa LDAP hakoreshejwe guhuza utamenyekanye kugira ngo haboneke Izina Ritandukanya (DN) ry'umukoresha.<br><br><i>Gushakisha kwihariye</i> - Hageragezwa gushakisha izina ry'umukoresha mu bubiko bwa LDAP hakoreshejwe Izina Ritandukanya (DN) ryihariye n'Ijambobanga ryihariye mu guhuza kugira ngo haboneke Izina Ritandukanya (DN) ry'umukoresha."

