msgid "This is the data that is being passed to the poller each time it runs. This data is then in turn executed/interpreted and the results are fed into the RRDfiles for graphing or the database for display."
msgstr "Aya ni yo makuru yoherezwa kuri poller buri gihe ikoze. Aya makuru na yo arakoreshwa/agasobanurwa maze ibisubizo bigashyirwa muri RRDfiles kugira ngo bikorwemo ibishushanyo cyangwa mu bubiko bw'amakuru kugira ngo byerekanwe."

#: utilities.php:2370
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibaza ry'amakuru bubika amakuru yakusanyijwe avuye mu bwoko bw'iyinjiza ry'ibaza ry'amakuru. Uduciro tuva muri iyi myanya dushobora gukoreshwa ahagenewe inyandiko ku Bishushanyo nk'ibisobanuro, inyandiko zihagaritse, na GPRINT ndetse no muri CDEF."

#: utilities.php:2372
msgid "Rebuild Poller Cache"
msgstr "Ongera wubake ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa Poller"

#: utilities.php:2376
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa Poller buzongera bukorwe nuhitamo ubu buryo. Koresha ubu buryo gusa mu gihe ububiko bw'amakuru bwagize ikibazo gikomeye ukaba ugihura n'ibibazo nyuma y'icyo kibazo kandi ukaba waramaze gukoresha ibikoresho bisana ububiko bw'amakuru. Ubundi buryo, niba ufite ibibazo ku Gikoresho runaka, ongera ubike icyo Gikoresho gusa kugira ngo wubake bundi bushya ububiko bwacyo bw'agateganyo bwa Poller. Hariho kandi uburyo bw'umurongo wa komande buhwanye n'iyi komande busabwa gukoreshwa kuri sisitemu nini."

#: utilities.php:2378
msgid "NOTE: On large systems, this command may take several minutes to hours to complete and therefore should not be run from the Cacti UI.  You can simply run 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' at the command line for more information."
msgstr "ICYITONDERWA: Kuri sisitemu nini, iyi komande ishobora gufata iminota myinshi cyangwa amasaha kugira ngo irangire bityo ntigomba gukoreshwa uciye ku rubuga rwa Cacti. Ushobora gusa gukoresha 'php -q cli/rebuild_poller_cache.php --help' ku murongo wa komande kugira ngo ubone amakuru arambuye."

#: utilities.php:2382
msgid "Rebuild Resource Cache"
msgstr "Ongera wubake ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibikenerwa"

#: utilities.php:2386
msgid "When operating multiple Data Collectors in Cacti, Cacti will attempt to maintain state for key files on all Data Collectors.  This includes all core, non-install related website and plugin files.  When you force a Resource Cache rebuild, Cacti will clear the local Resource Cache, and then rebuild it at the next scheduled poller start.  This will trigger all Remote Data Collectors to recheck their website and plugin files for consistency."
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha Ibikusanya amakuru byinshi muri Cacti, Cacti izagerageza kubungabunga imiterere ya dosiye z'ingenzi ku Bikusanya amakuru byose. Ibi birimo dosiye zose z'ibanze z'urubuga n'inyongera zitari izo kwishyiriramo. Iyo uhatiye iyubakwa rishya ry'ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibikenerwa, Cacti izakuraho ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibikenerwa bwaho, hanyuma yongere kubwubaka ku itangira rikurikira rya poller riteganyijwe. Ibi bizatuma Ibikusanya amakuru bya kure byose bongera kugenzura dosiye zabo z'urubuga n'iz'inyongera kugira ngo bihuzwe."

