msgstr "Ibikoresho bifasha bya Boost"

#: utilities.php:2391
msgid "View Boost Status"
msgstr "Reba imiterere ya Boost"

#: utilities.php:2393
msgid "This menu pick allows you to view various boost settings and statistics associated with the current running Boost configuration."
msgstr "Iri hitamo ryo kuri menu rigufasha kureba igenamiterere ritandukanye rya Boost n'ibarurishamibare bijyanye n'igenamiterere rya Boost riri gukora ubu."

#: utilities.php:2397
msgid "Data Source Statistics Utilities"
msgstr "Ibikoresho bifasha by'ibarurishamibare ry'inkomoko y'amakuru"

#: utilities.php:2398
msgid "Purge Data Source Statistics"
msgstr "Siba byose mu ibarurishamibare ry'inkomoko y'amakuru"

#: utilities.php:2402
msgid "This menu pick will purge all existing Data Source Statistics from the Database.  If Data Source Statistics is enabled, the Data Sources Statistics will start collection again on the next Data Collector pass."
msgstr "Iri hitamo ryo kuri menu rizasiba ibarurishamibare ryose ry'inkomoko y'amakuru riri mu bubiko bw'amakuru. Niba ibarurishamibare ry'inkomoko y'amakuru ryemejwe, ibarurishamibare ry'inkomoko y'amakuru rizongera gutangira gukusanywa mu rugendo rukurikira rw'Igikusanya amakuru."

#: utilities.php:2407
msgid "RRD Utilities"
msgstr "Ibikoresho bifasha bya RRD"

#: utilities.php:2408
msgid "RRDfile Cleaner"
msgstr "Isukura rya RRDfile"

#: utilities.php:2411
msgid "When you delete Data Sources from Cacti, the corresponding RRDfiles are not removed automatically.  Use this utility to facilitate the removal of these old files."
msgstr "Iyo usibye Inkomoko z'amakuru muri Cacti, dosiye za RRDfiles zijyanye na zo ntizikurwaho mu buryo bwikora. Koresha iki gikoresho gifasha kugira ngo wihutishe ikurwaho ry'izi dosiye zishaje."

#: utilities.php:2416
msgid "Use this utility to display problems with missing rrd files or missing values in rrdfiles. You need enable rrdcheck in Configuration->Settings->Data"
msgstr "Koresha iki gikoresho gifasha kugira ngo werekane ibibazo bya dosiye za rrd zibuze cyangwa uduciro tubuze muri rrdfiles. Ukeneye kwemeza rrdcheck muri Iboneza->Igenamiterere->Amakuru"

